<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM GROUP 96 NET AT PLN 57.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM GROUP 96 NET AT PLN 57.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektrim group results for</p>
